| **Před implementací** | GPT-5.2 | `review` | "Review approach first" |
| **Visual QA** | Gemini | Pro | Screenshot → analyze |
| **Content/lekce** | Gemini | Pro | Task Brief → generate |
| **UX/copy review** | Gemini | Pro | "Is this confusing?" |

